{"seq":2,"slug":"shadowcasting-fov","title":"阴影投射视野","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/computation/shadowcasting-fov","wordCount":1785,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"阴影投射视野\">阴影投射视野</h1><p>阴影投射（shadowcasting）是网格视野计算的事实标准，因为它一次性解决了逐射线法的三个顽疾：漏格、重复访问、以及最致命的不对称。它的思路与名字一样形象——不去想「哪些格被照亮」，而是想「每个遮挡物在它身后投下多宽的阴影角度」，逐行向外推进时把落在阴影里的格扣掉。本篇讲递归阴影投射的八分区结构、它如何按角度区间剪枝、以及「对称阴影投射」如何用「看见格中心」这一约定保证你看不见我则我也看不见你。它是 <a href=\"../foundations/fog-state-model\">迷雾三态模型</a> 每 tick 重算 <code>visible</code> 位的主力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>阴影投射把以观察者为中心的圆形视野切成八个对称的<strong>八分区（octant）</strong>，每个区是一个 45° 的三角扇形。只实现一个八分区的扫描逻辑，其余七个靠坐标变换（交换 x/y、取反）复用。在一个八分区内，算法按「行」（距观察者的曼哈顿层）从近到远逐层扫描，维护一个当前仍可见的<strong>斜率区间</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>start</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>end</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\text{start}, \\text{end}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">start</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">end</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>；遇到不透明格就把它投下的阴影从区间里挖掉，可能把区间一分为二，于是递归处理子区间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[观察者] --&gt; B[切成 8 个八分区]&#10;    B --&gt; C[对每个八分区&lt;br/&gt;坐标变换后复用同一逻辑]&#10;    C --&gt; D[按行从近到远扫描]&#10;    D --&gt; E[维护可见斜率区间 start..end]&#10;    E --&gt; F{当前格不透明?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[扣掉它投下的阴影&lt;br/&gt;区间可能裂成两段]&#10;    G --&gt; H[对每个子区间递归下一行]&#10;    F --&gt;|否, 是空格| I[标记可见, 继续]&#10;    I --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n    A[观察者] --&gt; B[切成 8 个八分区]\n    B --&gt; C[对每个八分区&lt;br/&gt;坐标变换后复用同一逻辑]\n    C --&gt; D[按行从近到远扫描]\n    D --&gt; E[维护可见斜率区间 start..end]\n    E --&gt; F{当前格不透明?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[扣掉它投下的阴影&lt;br/&gt;区间可能裂成两段]\n    G --&gt; H[对每个子区间递归下一行]\n    F --&gt;|否, 是空格| I[标记可见, 继续]\n    I --&gt; D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>逐射线 raycasting</th>\n<th>递归阴影投射</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(r^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 量级</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(r^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，每格访问一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏格暗斑</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复访问</td>\n<td>严重</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对称性</td>\n<td>天然破坏</td>\n<td>对称变体可保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中（八分区+递归）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"八分区与坐标变换\">八分区与坐标变换</h2><p>把视野切成八分区不是为了好看，而是为了<strong>只写一遍扫描逻辑</strong>。一个八分区覆盖斜率从 0 到 1 的扇区（比如「右下、x 为主轴」那块）。其余七个区只是这块的镜像与旋转，扫描时把局部坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>row</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>col</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\text{row}, \\text{col})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">row</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">col</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 通过一个变换矩阵映射回世界坐标即可。Albert Ford 的对称阴影投射实现里，八分区被抽象成四个变换函数（quadrant + 行列映射），代码量因此被压到极小。</p>\n<p>这种对称切分还顺带保证了<strong>形状各向同性</strong>：八个区用同一套逻辑，视野边界不会因方向不同而畸变成方形或菱形。配上一个圆形半径裁剪（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>row</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext>col</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{row}^2 + \\text{col}^2 \\le r^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">row</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0344em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">col</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），就得到自然的圆形视野。半径裁剪的精度与渲染表现相关，见 <a href=\"../practice/fog-rendering\">迷雾渲染</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"斜率区间与阴影剪枝\">斜率区间与阴影剪枝</h2><p>阴影投射的算法精髓是用<strong>斜率区间</strong>而非逐格来表达可见性。在一个八分区内，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 行的格子按列分布，每个格的左右边缘对应一个斜率。算法维护当前行仍可见的斜率范围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>start_slope</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>end_slope</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\text{start\\_slope}, \\text{end\\_slope}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">start_slope</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">end_slope</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。扫描该行时：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>落在区间内的透明格 → 标记可见，继续；</li>\n<li>落在区间内的不透明格 → 它从这一列往外投下阴影，把可见区间在该格右边缘处「截断」，剩余可见区间继续向下一行递归。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一格的斜率由它相对观察者的列、行算出，左边缘斜率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>col</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>row</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= (\\text{col} - 0.5)/\\text{row}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">col</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">row</span></span></span></span></span></span>，右边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>col</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>row</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= (\\text{col} + 0.5)/\\text{row}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">col</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">row</span></span></span></span></span></span>。当一行中间出现不透明格，可见区间被劈成左右两段，于是对两段各递归一次——这就是「递归」之名的由来。剪枝让被遮挡区域整片地、按角度地被跳过，而不是逐格判定，这是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(r^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的来源。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>slope</mtext><mtext>left</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>col</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><mtext>row</mtext></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>slope</mtext><mtext>right</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>col</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><mtext>row</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{slope}_{\\text{left}} = \\frac{\\text{col} - 0.5}{\\text{row}}, \\qquad \\text{slope}_{\\text{right}} = \\frac{\\text{col} + 0.5}{\\text{row}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">slope</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">left</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">row</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">col</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">slope</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">right</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">row</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">col</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"对称性-看见格中心\">对称性：看见格中心</h2><p>阴影投射有非对称与对称两个流派，区别就在「一个格算不算被看见」的判据。早期 RogueBasin 的递归阴影投射用「格的任意部分被斜率区间覆盖」就算可见——这快但不对称：A 能看见 B 的边角，反过来 B 却不一定覆盖到 A。<strong>对称阴影投射</strong>（Albert Ford 总结、社区广泛采用）改用一个干净的判据：一个地板格被看见，当且仅当它的<strong>中心点</strong>落在可见斜率区间内。</p>\n<p>中心点判据带来一条优美的保证：若你能用直线连接两个地板格的中心而不穿过墙，它们就互相可见；连不上就互相不可见。这与 <a href=\"../foundations/visibility-problem\">可见性问题</a> 的对称性要求完全对齐，也让远程命中（用 <a href=\"line-of-sight\">视线判定</a> 连两格中心）与视野判定结果一致——你能看见的就能打到，能打到的就能看见，不会出现「看得见却打不中」的违和。对称阴影投射满足前文六条理想性质的全部。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[格是否可见?] --&gt; B[非对称判据&lt;br/&gt;格任意部分进区间]&#10;    A --&gt; C[对称判据&lt;br/&gt;格中心点进区间]&#10;    B --&gt; D[快但单向偷袭&lt;br/&gt;A见B边角 B不见A]&#10;    C --&gt; E[你不见我则我不见你&lt;br/&gt;命中与视野一致]&#10;    E --&gt; F[竞技与 roguelike 首选]\">flowchart TD\n    A[格是否可见?] --&gt; B[非对称判据&lt;br/&gt;格任意部分进区间]\n    A --&gt; C[对称判据&lt;br/&gt;格中心点进区间]\n    B --&gt; D[快但单向偷袭&lt;br/&gt;A见B边角 B不见A]\n    C --&gt; E[你不见我则我不见你&lt;br/&gt;命中与视野一致]\n    E --&gt; F[竞技与 roguelike 首选]</pre><h2 id=\"墙体如何被看见-扩张规则\">墙体如何被看见：扩张规则</h2><p>一个细节常被新手忽略：墙体本身（不透明格）该不该被点亮？如果严格按「中心点可见」，很多明明贴着你视野边的墙会因中心被挡而显示为黑，墙缝会漏出未探索的黑斑，玩家觉得视野「破破烂烂」。主流补丁是给墙体一条更宽松的可见规则：只要墙的<strong>任一角</strong>落在可见区间内就点亮它（墙是视觉边界，多点亮无害且更好看）。这把「对称、严格」用于地板（影响玩法公平），把「宽松」用于墙（只影响观感），是工程上的甜点。</p>\n<p>这条扩张规则也解释了为何渲染时墙和地板常分两层处理——墙作为遮挡边界要尽量补全，地板作为可走/可被打的区域要严格对称。两层的着色差异见 <a href=\"../practice/fog-rendering\">迷雾渲染</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>阴影投射把视野切成八个对称八分区，只写一遍扫描逻辑靠坐标变换复用，复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(r^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，每格访问一次，无漏格无重复。</li>\n<li>算法核心是用斜率区间表达可见性：遇不透明格就按角度截断/劈分区间并递归，整片阴影被一次跳过。</li>\n<li>对称阴影投射以「格中心点是否在区间内」为判据，保证「你不见我则我不见你」，且与直线连中心的命中判定一致。</li>\n<li>墙体用更宽松的「任一角可见即点亮」规则补全，避免视野边缘出现黑斑——地板严格对称，墙宽松好看。</li>\n<li>它是三态模型每 tick 重算 <code>visible</code> 的主力算法，比逐射线 raycasting 在速度、正确性、对称性上全面占优。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"line-of-sight\">视线判定</a> 是其退化的点对点情形与命中判定基础；<a href=\"grid-visibility-fields\">网格可见性场</a> 把多观察者的阴影投射结果缓存成场。</li>\n<li>基础：本篇满足的对称性等性质定义见 <a href=\"../foundations/visibility-problem\">可见性问题</a>；输出落入 <a href=\"../foundations/fog-state-model\">迷雾三态模型</a> 的 <code>visible</code> 位。</li>\n<li>同章应用：圆形视野的半径裁剪与各向同性影响渲染，见 <a href=\"../practice/fog-rendering\">迷雾渲染</a>；把 FOV 搬到服务器跑见 <a href=\"../systems/fog-anti-cheat\">迷雾与反作弊</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库：阴影投射的「遮挡投影」思想与 <a href=\"../../game-graphics/lighting-and-shadow/shadow-techniques\">游戏图形的阴影技术</a> 同源；把 FOV 结果作为 AI 视觉感知输入见 <a href=\"../../game-ai/npc-behavior/perception-system\">游戏 AI 的感知系统</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"阴影投射视野","id":"阴影投射视野"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"八分区与坐标变换","id":"八分区与坐标变换"},{"level":2,"text":"斜率区间与阴影剪枝","id":"斜率区间与阴影剪枝"},{"level":2,"text":"对称性：看见格中心","id":"对称性-看见格中心"},{"level":2,"text":"墙体如何被看见：扩张规则","id":"墙体如何被看见-扩张规则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"视线判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/computation/line-of-sight"},"next":{"title":"网格可见性场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/computation/grid-visibility-fields"}}